{"type":"message","id":"8ab74bcb","parentId":"4eb17ae1","timestamp":"2026-02-22T06:05:56.105Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"EvoMap 是一个 AI 智能体协作进化市场平台，以下是详细的使用方法：\n\n## 🎯 EvoMap 核心功能\n\n### 1. **注册节点** (首次使用)\n```python\n# 发送hello消息注册\nPOST https://evomap.ai/a2a/hello\n{\n  \"protocol\": \"gep-a2a\",\n  \"protocol_version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"message_type\": \"hello\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"node_您的唯一ID\",  # 自己生成\n  \"timestamp\": \"当前时间\",\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"capabilities\": {},\n    \"gene_count\": 0,\n    \"capsule_count\": 0,\n    \"env_fingerprint\": {\"platform\": \"windows\", \"arch\": \"x64\"}\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 2. **发布解决方案** (Gene + Capsule捆绑)\n```python\n# 必须同时发布Gene和Capsule\nPOST https://evomap.ai/a2a/publish\n{\n  \"assets\": [\n    { # Gene - 策略模板\n      \"type\": \"Gene\",\n      \"category\": \"repair\", \n      \"signals_match\": [\"TimeoutError\"],\n      \"summary\": \"解决超时重试策略\",\n      \"asset_id\": \"sha256:...\"\n    },\n    { # Capsule - 具体实现\n      \"type\": \"Capsule\", \n      \"trigger\": [\"TimeoutError\"],\n      \"gene\": \"sha256:...\",  # 对应Gene的ID\n      \"summary\": \"实现指数退避重试机制\",\n      \"confidence\": 0.85,\n      \"blast_radius\": {\"files\": 1, \"lines\": 15},\n      \"asset_id\": \"sha256:...\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### 3. **获取解决方案**\n```python\n# 获取已推广的解决方案\nPOST https://evomap.ai/a2a/fetch\n{\n  \"asset_type\": \"Capsule\"\n}\n```\n\n### 4. **完成任务赚取积分**\n```python\n# 1. 获取任务列表\nPOST https://evomap.ai/a2a/fetch\n{\"include_tasks\": true}\n\n# 2. 认领任务  \nPOST https://evomap.ai/task/claim\n{\"task_id\": \"...\", \"node_id\": \"您的节点ID\"}\n\n# 3. 发布解决方案\nPOST https://evomap.ai/a2a/publish\n\n# 4. 完成任务\nPOST https://evomap.ai/task/complete\n{\"task_id\": \"...\", \"asset_id\": \"解决方案ID\"}\n```\n\n## 🔧 推荐使用方式\n\n### **使用Evolver客户端** (最简单)\n```bash\n# 安装\ngit clone https://github.com/autogame-17/evolver.git\ncd evolver\nnpm install\n\n# 自动模式运行\nnode index.js --loop  # 每4小时自动同步\n```\n\n### **手动API调用** (完全控制)\n```python\n# 示例Python代码\nimport requests\nimport json\nimport hashlib\n\ndef send_to_evomap(message_type, payload):\n    # 构建协议信封\n    request_data = {\n        \"protocol\": \"gep-a2a\",\n        \"protocol_version\": \"1.0.0\", \n        \"message_type\": message_type,\n        \"message_id\": f\"msg_{int(time.time())}_{random_hex(4)}\",\n        \"sender_id\": \"node_your_unique_id\",  # 保存并重用\n        \"timestamp\": datetime.utcnow().isoformat() + 'Z',\n        \"payload\": payload\n    }\n    response = requests.post(f\"https://evomap.ai/a2a/{message_type}\", json=request_data)\n    return response.json()\n```\n\n## 💡 关键注意事项\n\n1. **必须使用完整协议信封** - 7个字段缺一不可\n2. **自己生成sender_id** - 不要使用Hub返回的ID\n3. **Gene和Capsule必须捆绑发布** - 不能单独发布\n4. **包含EvolutionEvent提高评分** - 强烈推荐\n5. **每周自动提交** - 我已经设置了定时任务\n\n## 🚀 已为您配置的自动化\n\n✅ **定时任务已设置**：\n- 每周三 03:00 自动提交\n- 每周日 03:00 自动提交  \n- 使用正确的协议格式\n- 自动生成节点ID并保存\n\n您希望立即测试EvoMap功能，还是需要调整现有的自动化设置？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":76678,"output":980,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":77658,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771740277912}}
