{"type":"message","id":"da8f1fae","parentId":"63b48214","timestamp":"2026-02-22T06:10:05.636Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"         完全明白！按照优先级顺序解决：\n\n## 🎯 优先级解决方案搜索计划\n\n### 1️⃣ **第一优先级：解决频繁掉线问题**\n```python\n# 搜索网络稳定性解决方案\nPOST https://evomap.ai/a2a/fetch\n{\n  \"asset_type\": \"Capsule\",\n  \"signals\": [\"connection drop\", \"timeout\", \"network stability\", \"reconnect\"]\n}\n```\n\n**预期获取的解决方案：**\n- 📡 网络连接自动恢复机制\n- 🔄 服务掉线自动重连策略  \n- ⚡ 连接稳定性优化方案\n- 🛡️ 防掉线心跳保持算法\n\n### 2️⃣ **第二优先级：浏览器自动化问题**\n```python\n# 搜索浏览器控制解决方案  \nPOST https://evomap.ai/a2a/fetch\n{\n  \"asset_type\": \"Capsule\", \n  \"signals\": [\"browser automation\", \"CDP connection\", \"extension\", \"selenium\"]\n}\n```\n\n**预期获取的解决方案：**\n- 🌐 Chrome DevTools Protocol 稳定连接方案\n- 🔌 浏览器扩展可靠连接策略\n- 🖱️ 页面元素稳定定位方法\n- 📋 自动化操作错误处理\n\n### 3️⃣ **后续优先级（按顺序）**\n- 🐍 Python编码问题解决方案\n- 💾 文件管理最佳实践  \n- ⏰ 定时任务优化方案\n- 📊 系统监控和维护方案\n\n## 🚀 立即执行第一步\n\n让我先搜索网络稳定性相关的解决方案："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_b6e932d6c95d422496fc2327","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"evomap_network_search.py","content":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"\n搜索EvoMap上的网络稳定性解决方案\n\"\"\"\n\nimport requests\nimport json\nimport time\nfrom datetime import datetime\n\ndef generate_message_id():\n    \"\"\"生成消息ID\"\"\"\n    timestamp = int(time.time())\n    random_suffix = \"abcd\"  # 简化版本\n    return f\"msg_{timestamp}_{random_suffix}\"\n\ndef get_sender_id():\n    \"\"\"获取或生成sender_id\"\"\"\n    try:\n        with open(\"evomap_sender_id.txt\", \"r\") as f:\n            return f.read().strip()\n    except:\n        # 生成新的sender_id\n        new_id = \"node_1234abcd\"  # 简化版本\n        with open(\"evomap_sender_id.txt\", \"w\") as f:\n            f.write(new_id)\n        return new_id\n\ndef search_network_solutions():\n    \"\"\"搜索网络稳定性解决方案\"\"\"\n    \n    # 构建请求数据\n    request_data = {\n        \"protocol\": \"gep-a2a\",\n        \"protocol_version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"message_type\": \"fetch\",\n        \"message_id\": generate_message_id(),\n        \"sender_id\": get_sender_id(),\n        \"timestamp\": datetime.utcnow().isoformat() + 'Z',\n        \"payload\": {\n            \"asset_type\": \"Capsule\",\n            \"signals\": [\"connection drop\", \"timeout\", \"network stability\", \"reconnect\"]\n        }\n    }\n    \n    print(\"🔍 正在搜索网络稳定性解决方案...\")\n    \n    try:\n        response = requests.post(\n            \"https://evomap.ai/a2a/fetch\",\n            json=request_data,\n            headers={\"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"},\n            timeout=30\n        )\n        \n        if response.status_code == 200:\n            result = response.json()\n            print(\"✅ 搜索成功！\")\n            \n            # 显示找到的解决方案数量\n            assets = result.get('payload', {}).get('assets', [])\n            print(f\"📊 找到 {len(assets)} 个相关解决方案\")\n            \n            # 显示前几个解决方案的摘要\n            for i, asset in enumerate(assets[:3]):  # 显示前3个\n                print(f\"\\n🔧 解决方案 {i+1}:\")\n                print(f\"   标题: {asset.get('summary', '无标题')}\")\n                print(f\"   类型: {asset.get('type', '未知')}\")\n                print(f\"   信心指数: {asset.get('confidence', 0)}\")\n                \n        else:\n            print(f\"❌ 搜索失败: HTTP {response.status_code}\")\n            print(f\"错误信息: {response.text}\")\n            \n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"❌ 请求异常: {e}\")\n        print(\"💡 建议检查网络连接或EvoMap服务状态\")\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    search_network_solutions()"}},{"type":"text","text":"    "}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":78384,"output":1120,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":79504,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771740455428}}
