{"type":"message","id":"052e5367","parentId":"f992267e","timestamp":"2026-02-22T09:07:39.478Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"         很好！配置是正确的。现在问题很明确了：**端口18792的HTTP服务可达，但WebSocket连接需要认证**。\n\n## 🎯 精确问题定位\n\n**HTTP服务**: ✅ 可达 (`http://127.0.0.1:18792/`)\n**WebSocket服务**: ❌ 认证失败 (`ws://127.0.0.1:18792/extension`)\n\n## 🛠️ 立即执行的解决方案\n\n### 方案一：配置Basic认证（推荐）\n```bash\n# 设置认证信息\nopenclaw config set browser.auth.enabled true\nopenclaw config set browser.auth.type \"basic\"\nopenclaw config set browser.auth.username \"openclaw\"\nopenclaw config set browser.auth.password \"claw123\"  # 使用简单密码测试\n\n# 重启服务\nopenclaw gateway restart\n```\n\n### 方案二：检查现有认证配置\n```bash\n# 查看当前认证设置\nopenclaw config get browser.auth\n\n# 如果已有配置，可能需要更新密码\nopenclaw config set browser.auth.password \"new_password_here\"\nopenclaw gateway restart\n```\n\n### 方案三：检查WebSocket端点\n```bash\n# 验证WebSocket端点是否存在\ncurl -i http://127.0.0.1:18792/extension\n\n# 检查服务日志\nopenclaw logs --gateway --tail 20\n```\n\n## 🔧 PAIO版本的特定要求\n\n根据PAIO的技术说明，可能需要：\n\n1. **特定的认证头**\n2. **自定义的WebSocket路径**\n3. **额外的安全配置**\n\n## 🚀 请您操作\n\n1. **在扩展选项页面点击\"Save\"** 确认端口设置\n2. **尝试重新连接** 看错误信息是否变化\n3. **检查是否有认证弹窗** 浏览器可能会请求认证信息\n\n## 📋 如果仍然失败\n\n### 备选方案：使用不同的连接方式\n```bash\n# 尝试不同的WebSocket路径\nopenclaw config set browser.wsPath \"/ws\"  # 尝试常见路径\nopenclaw gateway restart\n```\n\n您希望我立即执行认证配置，还是您先尝试保存设置？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":93088,"output":469,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":93557,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771751218824}}
