{"type":"message","id":"f8ceab1a","parentId":"46ada30a","timestamp":"2026-02-22T09:08:58.764Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"         我来详细说明Basic认证的具体操作步骤：\n\n## 🛠️ Basic认证配置详细步骤\n\n### 第一步：检查当前配置\n```bash\n# 查看当前认证设置\nopenclaw config get browser.auth\n\n# 查看网关完整配置\nopenclaw config get --section browser\n```\n\n### 第二步：设置Basic认证\n```bash\n# 启用认证\nopenclaw config set browser.auth.enabled true\n\n# 设置认证类型为Basic\nopenclaw config set browser.auth.type \"basic\"\n\n# 设置用户名（建议使用openclaw）\nopenclaw config set browser.auth.username \"openclaw\"\n\n# 设置密码（建议使用强密码）\nopenclaw config set browser.auth.password \"OpenClaw_Browser_123!\"\n\n# 验证配置\nopenclaw config get browser.auth\n```\n\n### 第三步：重启网关服务\n```bash\n# 彻底重启网关\nopenclaw gateway stop\nopenclaw gateway start\n\n# 检查服务状态\nopenclaw gateway status\n```\n\n### 第四步：验证认证配置\n```bash\n# 测试HTTP端点认证\ncurl -u openclaw:OpenClaw_Browser_123! http://127.0.0.1:18792/\n\n# 检查服务日志\nopenclaw logs --gateway --tail 10\n```\n\n### 第五步：配置浏览器扩展\n1. **打开扩展选项页面**\n2. **在认证设置部分输入**：\n   - 用户名: `openclaw`\n   - 密码: `OpenClaw_Browser_123!`\n3. **点击Save保存**\n4. **重新点击扩展图标连接**\n\n## 🔧 如果认证失败的处理\n\n### 检查防火墙规则\n```bash\n# 检查防火墙是否允许本地连接\nnetsh advfirewall firewall show rule name=all | findstr \"18792\"\n\n# 如果被阻止，添加允许规则\nnetsh advfirewall firewall add rule name=\"OpenClaw Browser\" dir=in action=allow protocol=TCP localport=18792\n```\n\n### 检查服务权限\n```bash\n# 检查服务运行账户\nGet-WmiObject Win32_Service | Where-Object {$_.Name -like \"*OpenClaw*\"} | Select-Object Name, StartName\n\n# 如果需要，以管理员身份运行\nStart-Process powershell -Verb RunAs -ArgumentList \"openclaw gateway restart\"\n```\n\n## 📋 完整配置示例\n\n```bash\n# 完整的Basic认证配置流程\nopenclaw config set browser.auth.enabled true\nopenclaw config set browser.auth.type \"basic\" \nopenclaw config set browser.auth.username \"openclaw\"\nopenclaw config set browser.auth.password \"YourSecurePassword123!\"\nopenclaw config set browser.port 18792\nopenclaw gateway restart\n```\n\n您准备好密码后，我可以立即执行这些配置命令！建议密码包含大小写字母、数字和特殊字符。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":93646,"output":628,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":94274,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771751290248}}
{"type":"message","id":"b8297612","parentId":"f8ceab1a","timestamp":"2026-02-22T09:08:59.266Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"68fed80e-494d-4807-87b4-bb32166279b0\",\n  \"sender\": \"openclaw-control-ui\"\n}\n```\n\n[Sun 2026-02-22 17:08 GMT+8] 不是啊 你要明确的说细节，是命令窗口还是页面 还是哪里 然后哪个功能区 详细说"}],"timestamp":1771751339247}}
{"type":"message","id":"b7153d15","parentId":"b8297612","timestamp":"2026-02-22T09:09:49.519Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                                                    您说得对！我需要提供非常具体的操作细节。让我详细说明每个步骤的具体位置和操作方法：\n\n## 🖥️ **具体操作位置和步骤**\n\n### **第一步：在命令提示符（CMD/PowerShell）中操作**\n**位置**：Windows命令提示符或PowerShell窗口\n\n```bash\n# 1. 打开命令提示符（按Win+R，输入cmd，回车）\n# 2. 逐行执行以下命令：\n\n# 检查当前配置\nopenclaw config get browser.auth\n\n# 设置Basic认证\nopenclaw config set browser.auth.enabled true\nopenclaw config set browser.auth.type \"basic\"\nopenclaw config set browser.auth.username \"openclaw\"\nopenclaw config set browser.auth.password \"OpenClaw_Browser_123!\"\n\n# 重启服务\nopenclaw gateway restart\n```\n\n---\n\n### **第二步：在浏览器扩展选项中操作**\n**位置**：Chrome浏览器 → 扩展程序页面\n\n1. **打开扩展管理**：\n   - 在浏览器地址栏输入：`chrome://extensions/`\n   - 找到\"OpenClaw Browser Relay\"扩展\n   - 点击\"详细信息\"\n\n2. **配置认证信息**：\n   - 找到\"选项\"或\"设置\"按钮并点击\n   - 在认证设置部分输入：\n     - **用户名**: `openclaw`\n     - **密码**: `OpenClaw_Browser_123!`\n   - 点击\"Save\"保存\n\n3. **重新连接**：\n   - 回到抖音标签页\n   - 点击浏览器右上角的OpenClaw扩展图标\n   - 确认图标变成绿色（已连接）\n\n---\n\n### **第三步：在系统防火墙中操作**（如果需要）\n**位置**：Windows防火墙高级设置\n\n1. **打开防火墙**：\n   - 按Win+R，输入`wf.msc`，回车\n   - 或者：控制面板 → 系统和安全 → Windows Defender防火墙\n\n2. **添加入站规则**：\n   - 点击\"入站规则\" → \"新建规则\"\n   - 选择\"端口\" → TCP → 特定本地端口：`18792`\n   - 选择\"允许连接\" → 所有配置文件打勾\n   - 名称：`OpenClaw Browser Relay`\n\n---\n\n### **第四步：验证连接**\n**位置**：命令提示符 + 浏览器\n\n```bash\n# 在命令提示符中测试连接\ncurl -u openclaw:OpenClaw_Browser_123! http://127.0.0.1:18792/\n\n# 检查服务状态\nopenclaw gateway status\n```\n\n---\n\n## 📋 **操作顺序建议**\n\n1. **首先**在命令提示符中执行配置命令\n2. **然后**在浏览器扩展选项中设置认证信息  \n3. **最后**点击扩展图标重新连接\n\n## 🆘 **如果遇到问题**\n\n**检查服务日志**：\n```bash\nopenclaw logs --gateway --tail 20\n```\n\n**检查端口占用**：\n```bash\nnetstat -ano | findstr :18792\n```\n\n请您按照这个详细的步骤操作，我会一步步指导您！"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":94373,"output":672,"c