{"type":"message","id":"5323e58f","parentId":"c7c85de2","timestamp":"2026-02-22T09:11:43.063Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                                                                                                                 太好了！我找到了关键信息。在 `gateway` 部分可以看到：\n\n## 🎯 正确的配置路径\n\n**当前配置**：\n```json\n\"gateway\": {\n  \"port\": 18789,  // 注意：端口是18789，不是18792\n  \"mode\": \"local\",\n  \"bind\": \"loopback\", \n  \"auth\": {\n    \"mode\": \"none\"  // 认证模式为\"none\"，需要改为\"basic\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## 🛠️ 正确的配置命令\n\n### 第一步：修改认证模式\n```bash\nopenclaw config set gateway.auth.mode \"basic\"\n```\n\n### 第二步：设置认证信息\n```bash\nopenclaw config set gateway.auth.basic.username \"openclaw\"\nopenclaw config set gateway.auth.basic.password \"OpenClaw_Browser_123!\"\n```\n\n### 第三步：确认端口设置\n```bash\n# 检查当前端口（应该是18789）\nopenclaw config get gateway.port\n\n# 如果需要修改为18792\nopenclaw config set gateway.port 18792\n```\n\n### 第四步：重启网关\n```bash\nopenclaw gateway restart\n```\n\n## 🔧 还需要在扩展选项中修改\n\n**在浏览器扩展选项中**：\n1. 将端口从 `18792` 改为 `18789`（或保持18792如果修改了配置）\n2. 设置相同的用户名和密码\n3. 点击Save保存\n\n请您先执行这些命令，然后我指导您在扩展选项中完成配置！"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":84969,"output":333,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":85302,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771751466734}}
