{"type":"message","id":"565d231e","parentId":"6f2d9972","timestamp":"2026-02-22T10:08:20.283Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                                                                                                                             太好了！日志显示**连接正在尝试**，但存在握手问题：\n\n## 🔍 日志分析\n\n**问题**: `invalid request frame` - WebSocket握手时请求帧格式无效\n\n**原因**: 扩展发送的WebSocket握手请求格式与网关期望的不匹配\n\n## 🛠️ 解决方案\n\n这可能是因为PAIO定制版扩展与官方网关版本不兼容。让我尝试：\n\n### 方案一：使用官方扩展\n```bash\n# 安装官方扩展\nopenclaw browser extension install\n\n# 重启网关\nopenclaw gateway restart\n```\n\n### 方案二：调整网关配置\n```bash\n# 尝试不同的WebSocket路径\nopenclaw config set browser.wsPath \"/\"\n\n# 或者禁用某些验证\nopenclaw config set browser.strict false\n\n# 重启网关\nopenclaw gateway restart\n```\n\n### 方案三：检查扩展版本兼容性\nPAIO定制版扩展可能需要特定版本的网关服务\n\n**请您先尝试等待几分钟**，让扩展完成连接尝试。如果持续失败，我们可能需要使用官方扩展版本。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":98228,"output":232,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":98460,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771754865521}}
