{"type":"message","id":"7a601186","parentId":"699d55a7","timestamp":"2026-02-22T10:46:04.031Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                                                                                                                             服务仍然报告没有连接的标签页。请您：\n\n## 🎯 **最后一步验证**\n\n**在浏览器中确认：**\n1. 扩展图标是什么颜色和状态？\n2. 点击扩展图标后状态如何变化？\n3. 选项页面中端口和token设置是否正确？\n\n## 🔧 **如果仍然失败**\n\n可能需要**重新启动浏览器服务**：\n```bash\n# 彻底重启浏览器服务\nopenclaw browser service restart\n\n# 或者重新注册服务\nopenclaw browser service install --force\n```\n\n请您告诉我扩展图标的当前状态，这样我能更好地诊断问题！"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":101269,"output":128,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":101397,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771757146834}}
