{"type":"message","id":"ad7ecd5d","parentId":"340b5f4d","timestamp":"2026-02-22T10:53:01.471Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"              I need to store the memory about the Chrome browser extension connection troubleshooting process. Let me create the memory file:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_d29efc3f175f48fa8fdf996e","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"memory/2026-02-22.md","content":"# 2026-02-22 Memory\n\n## Chrome浏览器扩展连接问题排查\n\n### 问题描述\n- OpenClaw浏览器扩展无法正常连接\n- WebSocket握手失败：\"invalid request frame\"\n- 扩展图标显示黄色背景+三个白点（连接中状态）\n\n### 环境信息\n- Chrome版本：144.0.7547.0（开发版）\n- OpenClaw网关端口：18789\n- 扩展配置：端口18789，Token正确\n- 中继服务器可达：http://127.0.0.1:18789/\n\n### 关键发现\n1. Chrome flags中 `extensions-on-chrome-urls` 和 `extensions-on-extension-urls` 被禁用\n2. 可能阻止了扩展与chrome://协议的通信\n3. 网关日志显示WebSocket握手请求帧格式无效\n\n### 已尝试解决方案\n1. 确认使用官方扩展（非PAIO定制版）\n2. 端口配置正确（18789）\n3. Token配置正确\n4. 网关服务运行正常\n\n### 待解决问题\n- 启用关键Chrome flags：\n  - `#extensions-on-chrome-urls` → Enabled\n  - `#extensions-on-extension-urls` → Enabled\n- 重启Chrome浏览器\n- 重新尝试连接\n\n### 后续步骤\n1. 启用被禁用的extensions flags\n2. 完全重启Chrome浏览器\n3. 重新测试扩展连接\n4. 如果仍然失败，考虑降级到Chrome稳定版"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":107620,"output":400,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":108020,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771757541246}}
