{"type":"message","id":"d44cc210","parentId":"fe9df24a","timestamp":"2026-02-22T10:58:47.288Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                                                             您说\"继续\"，但我不确定您想要我继续什么。基于我们的对话，下一步应该是：\n\n## 🎯 **请您立即执行的操作**\n\n**在Chrome flags页面（chrome://flags）：**\n\n1. **搜索**: `extensions-on-chrome-urls`\n   - 设置为：**Enabled**\n\n2. **搜索**: `extensions-on-extension-urls`  \n   - 设置为：**Enabled**\n\n3. **搜索**: `enable-experimental-web-platform-features`\n   - 设置为：**Enabled**\n\n4. **完全重启Chrome浏览器**\n\n## ❓ **您希望我继续什么？**\n\n- 如果您已经修改了flags并重启了浏览器，请告诉我扩展连接的状态\n- 如果您需要帮助修改flags，请告诉我遇到了什么问题\n- 如果您想尝试其他解决方案，请告诉我您的想法\n\n**请您明确告诉我下一步应该继续什么？**"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":47253,"output":188,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":47441,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771757882561}}
