{"type":"message","id":"b37bea18","parentId":"f75fe663","timestamp":"2026-02-22T11:07:19.952Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                                                                                                                             我发现问题了！**浏览器配置文件使用的是18792端口**，但网关运行在18789端口！\n\n## 🛠️ **立即修复方案**\n\n### **方案一：更新浏览器配置文件**\n```bash\n# 更新chrome配置使用18789端口\nopenclaw browser update-profile chrome --cdp-url \"http://127.0.0.1:18789/\"\n```\n\n### **方案二：创建新的配置文件**\n```bash\n# 创建使用正确端口的配置文件\nopenclaw browser create-profile --name douyin --driver extension --cdp-url \"http://127.0.0.1:18789/\" --color \"#FF0000\"\n```\n\n### **方案三：重启网关使用18792端口**\n```bash\n# 或者将网关端口改为18792\nopenclaw config set gateway.port 18792\nopenclaw gateway restart\n```\n\n## 🎯 **推荐方案**\n\n**建议使用方案一**（更新现有配置），因为：\n1. 扩展已经配置为18789端口\n2. 网关运行在18789端口\n3. 只需要更新浏览器配置文件\n\n请您执行：\n```bash\nopenclaw browser update-profile chrome --cdp-url \"http://127.0.0.1:18789/\"\n```\n\n然后重新尝试连接！这应该能解决端口不匹配的问题。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":49537,"output":283,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":49820,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771758385949}}
